      <p class="v" style="line-height:19px;font-size:18px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.1px;color:rgba(17,17,17,1)"><a class="asap-link" href="https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/e30lw28u6bcxb9qo4hfut/ASAP_PORTFOLIO-2026.pdf?rlkey=tkmd3ic6opwkv4myyz4eu3eo3&st=45kf96yn&dl=0" target="_self" rel="noopener noreferrer">Презентация с кейсами тут,</a></p>
    </div>

    <div class="widget" data-id="6a633ee6a631af4332f88de6" style="left: 50%; top: 50%; width: 129.1px; height: 20px; margin-left: 311.99px; margin-top: 140.04px; z-index: 325; zoom: 0.988417;">
      <p class="v" style="line-height:20px;font-size:18px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.1px;color:rgba(17,17,17,1)">ссылка на</p>
